## Self-Test

The KC868-A16 self-test firmware includes these probes:

| Probe | What it checks |
|-------|----------------|
| I2C Scan | All 4 PCF8574 addresses respond (0x24, 0x25, 0x22, 0x21) |
| Relay Cycle | Each of 16 relays activates and readback confirms state |
| Digital Inputs | All 16 optocoupled inputs readable |
| ADC Baseline | All 4 ADC channels return valid voltage |
| Sensor Headers | GPIO32, GPIO33, GPIO14 responsive |
| Ethernet PHY | LAN8720 link detected |

Probes not applicable to this board (OLED, LoRa, WiFi, battery) are automatically excluded.
